{
  "format_version": 1,
  "product": {
    "id": "mountain-letter",
    "title": "山口来信",
    "entry": {
      "package": "main",
      "graph": "journey"
    },
    "arguments": {},
    "shared": {
      "helped": false,
      "letter": false,
      "rations": 3,
      "rests": 0
    },
    "shared_labels": {
      "helped": "已帮助旅人",
      "letter": "已取信件",
      "rations": "干粮",
      "rests": "歇脚次数"
    },
    "bindings": [
      {
        "from": {
          "package": "main",
          "graph": "journey",
          "port": "camp"
        },
        "to": {
          "package": "camp",
          "graph": "visit"
        }
      },
      {
        "from": {
          "package": "main",
          "graph": "journey",
          "port": "road"
        },
        "to": {
          "package": "road",
          "graph": "crossing"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "packages": {
    "camp": {
      "id": "example.mountain-camp",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "exports": [
        "visit"
      ],
      "content": {
        "fire": {
          "title": "篝火夜谈",
          "paragraphs": [
            "{{parameter.visitor}}在火边坐下。守火老人用树枝拨了拨炭，把空出来的地方让给你。",
            "这次停留，老人已招呼过你 {{local.greetings}} 次。袋中还剩 {{shared.rations}} 份干粮；此前你在这里歇过 {{shared.rests}} 次脚。"
          ]
        },
        "letter": {
          "title": "老者的信",
          "paragraphs": [
            "老人从衣襟里取出信，抚平封口上的折痕。信封上没有名字，只画着山口石门的轮廓。",
            "“交到守门人的手里就好。”他说完，便把目光移回火上。"
          ]
        },
        "rest": {
          "title": "整理行囊",
          "paragraphs": [
            "你吃了一份干粮，等湿透的衣袖慢慢烤干。老人替你收紧背带，提醒你沿途当心落石。",
            "天边还留着一点亮色。现在可以重新上路了。"
          ]
        }
      },
      "graphs": {
        "visit": {
          "title": "营地互动",
          "parameters": {
            "visitor": "text"
          },
          "locals": {
            "greetings": 0
          },
          "shared": {
            "letter": "bool",
            "rations": "int",
            "rests": "int"
          },
          "imports": {},
          "outcomes": [
            "left",
            "rested"
          ],
          "entry": "greet",
          "nodes": {
            "fire": {
              "type_id": "narrata.decision",
              "data": {
                "choices": [
                  {
                    "assignments": [
                      {
                        "target": {
                          "name": "letter",
                          "scope": "shared"
                        },
                        "value": {
                          "kind": "literal",
                          "value": true
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "letter",
                    "label": "询问老人留下的信",
                    "target": "letter",
                    "visible_if": {
                      "kind": "not",
                      "value": {
                        "kind": "read",
                        "name": "letter",
                        "scope": "shared"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "assignments": [
                      {
                        "target": {
                          "name": "rations",
                          "scope": "shared"
                        },
                        "value": {
                          "kind": "binary",
                          "left": {
                            "kind": "read",
                            "name": "rations",
                            "scope": "shared"
                          },
                          "op": "sub",
                          "right": {
                            "kind": "literal",
                            "value": 1
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "target": {
                          "name": "rests",
                          "scope": "shared"
                        },
                        "value": {
                          "kind": "binary",
                          "left": {
                            "kind": "read",
                            "name": "rests",
                            "scope": "shared"
                          },
                          "op": "add",
                          "right": {
                            "kind": "literal",
                            "value": 1
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "disabled_reason": "干粮已经用完",
                    "enabled_if": {
                      "kind": "binary",
                      "left": {
                        "kind": "read",
                        "name": "rations",
                        "scope": "shared"
                      },
                      "op": "gt",
                      "right": {
                        "kind": "literal",
                        "value": 0
                      }
                    },
                    "id": "rest",
                    "label": "吃一份干粮，在火边歇脚",
                    "target": "rest"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "leave",
                    "label": "收拾行囊，回到驿站",
                    "target": "left"
                  }
                ],
                "content": "fire"
              }
            },
            "greet": {
              "type_id": "narrata.mutate",
              "data": {
                "assignments": [
                  {
                    "target": {
                      "name": "greetings",
                      "scope": "local"
                    },
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "binary",
                      "left": {
                        "kind": "read",
                        "name": "greetings",
                        "scope": "local"
                      },
                      "op": "add",
                      "right": {
                        "kind": "literal",
                        "value": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "next": "fire"
              }
            },
            "left": {
              "type_id": "narrata.return",
              "data": {
                "outcome": "left"
              }
            },
            "letter": {
              "type_id": "narrata.content",
              "data": {
                "content": "letter",
                "label": "收好信，回到篝火旁",
                "next": "fire"
              }
            },
            "rest": {
              "type_id": "narrata.content",
              "data": {
                "content": "rest",
                "label": "向老人告别",
                "next": "rested"
              }
            },
            "rested": {
              "type_id": "narrata.return",
              "data": {
                "outcome": "rested"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "id": "example.mountain-main",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "exports": [
        "journey"
      ],
      "content": {
        "gate": {
          "title": "抵达山口",
          "paragraphs": [
            "石门从雾里显出轮廓。守门人提着灯走下台阶，先看了看你身后的路，才伸出手。",
            "“驿站那边，有消息吗？”他问。"
          ]
        },
        "station": {
          "title": "旧驿站",
          "paragraphs": [
            "暮色将山谷染成淡淡的灰紫，旧驿站的木牌在风中轻轻晃动，字迹斑驳，几乎看不清原来的名号。这里曾是往来行旅歇脚换马的所在，现在只剩一间低矮的木屋，屋顶上落满了枯叶。",
            "你推开吱呀作响的木门，屋内空荡，只有一张破旧的桌子。登记册的最后一页写着：往山口去的人，请先到营地找守火老人。他还留着一封信。",
            "夜色渐深，冷风从门缝里钻进来。前方的山路看不清尽头，而不远处似乎有一处营地的火光在摇曳。你需要决定接下来的行动。"
          ]
        }
      },
      "graphs": {
        "journey": {
          "title": "主线",
          "parameters": {},
          "locals": {},
          "shared": {
            "helped": "bool",
            "letter": "bool",
            "rations": "int",
            "rests": "int"
          },
          "imports": {
            "camp": {
              "parameters": {
                "visitor": "text"
              },
              "outcomes": [
                "left",
                "rested"
              ]
            },
            "road": {
              "parameters": {},
              "outcomes": [
                "crossed",
                "retreated"
              ]
            }
          },
          "outcomes": [
            "arrived",
            "delivered"
          ],
          "entry": "station",
          "nodes": {
            "arrived": {
              "type_id": "narrata.return",
              "data": {
                "outcome": "arrived"
              }
            },
            "camp": {
              "type_id": "narrata.call",
              "data": {
                "arguments": {
                  "visitor": {
                    "kind": "literal",
                    "value": "你"
                  }
                },
                "on_return": {
                  "left": "station",
                  "rested": "station"
                },
                "target": {
                  "kind": "import",
                  "port": "camp"
                }
              }
            },
            "delivered": {
              "type_id": "narrata.return",
              "data": {
                "outcome": "delivered"
              }
            },
            "gate": {
              "type_id": "narrata.decision",
              "data": {
                "choices": [
                  {
                    "disabled_reason": "需要先从营地老人那里取到信件",
                    "enabled_if": {
                      "kind": "read",
                      "name": "letter",
                      "scope": "shared"
                    },
                    "id": "deliver",
                    "label": "将老人的信交给守门人",
                    "target": "delivered"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "arrive",
                    "label": "告诉他沿途的见闻，结束旅程",
                    "target": "arrived"
                  }
                ],
                "content": "gate"
              }
            },
            "road": {
              "type_id": "narrata.call",
              "data": {
                "arguments": {},
                "on_return": {
                  "crossed": "gate",
                  "retreated": "station"
                },
                "target": {
                  "kind": "import",
                  "port": "road"
                }
              }
            },
            "station": {
              "type_id": "narrata.decision",
              "data": {
                "choices": [
                  {
                    "id": "road",
                    "label": "沿山路出发",
                    "target": "road"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "camp",
                    "label": "到营地歇脚",
                    "target": "camp"
                  }
                ],
                "content": "station"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "road": {
      "id": "example.mountain-road",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "exports": [
        "crossing"
      ],
      "content": {
        "fog": {
          "title": "迷雾弥漫",
          "paragraphs": [
            "你沿旧路慢慢摸索，雾水很快打湿了衣袖。每当碎石从脚边滑下，你便停一停，听它落到底的声音。",
            "山口终于出现在前方，灯火在雾里摇晃。"
          ]
        },
        "rocks": {
          "title": "落石滚下",
          "paragraphs": [
            "转过山脚，几块碎石从上方滚落。你扶住岩壁，等响声停下，才发现一个挑着空篮的旅人坐在路边。",
            "他看上去饿了一整天，却认得山口的路。"
          ]
        },
        "trail": {
          "title": "发现小径",
          "paragraphs": [
            "旅人接过干粮，把空篮重新背好。他没有多问你从哪里来，只领着你拨开一丛低矮的灌木。",
            "这条路绕过了塌方。石缝里透出风，远处已经能看见山口的灯。"
          ]
        }
      },
      "graphs": {
        "crossing": {
          "title": "山路事件",
          "parameters": {},
          "locals": {},
          "shared": {
            "helped": "bool",
            "rations": "int"
          },
          "imports": {},
          "outcomes": [
            "crossed",
            "retreated"
          ],
          "entry": "rocks",
          "nodes": {
            "crossed": {
              "type_id": "narrata.return",
              "data": {
                "outcome": "crossed"
              }
            },
            "fog": {
              "type_id": "narrata.content",
              "data": {
                "content": "fog",
                "label": "走向灯火",
                "next": "crossed"
              }
            },
            "retreated": {
              "type_id": "narrata.return",
              "data": {
                "outcome": "retreated"
              }
            },
            "rocks": {
              "type_id": "narrata.decision",
              "data": {
                "choices": [
                  {
                    "assignments": [
                      {
